msgctxt "64"
msgid "Extra! Extra!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Guilty criminal of six-year-old murder turns herself in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"The man originally accused of the crime now stands to\r\n"
"be acquitted at a new trial!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I was wrong about the media. I thought you just went from\r\n"
"one person to the next, looking for gossip."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"I didn't think you cared about the people in your articles.\r\n"
"I figured you just forgot about them the second they left\r\n"
"your pages..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"But you've been worrying about my brother this whole time.\r\n"
"You even proved his innocence. There <Italic>are</Italic> decent people in\r\n"
"the media."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thank you so much for helping him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Nozomi-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I also have to apologize for the way I treated you. I want\r\n"
"to give you a reward for helping me get a retrial for my\r\n"
"brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"You don't owe me anything. As much as I hate to admit it,\r\n"
"I didn't do anything on this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Proving your brother's innocence was all the work of\r\n"
"Kiryu-san here. I certainly don't deserve any reward from\r\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about? You did what a real journalist\r\n"
"is supposed to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Sure, you wrote an article saying Akechi was a murderer...\r\n"
"But now you've written an article clearing his name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Isn't that the way a real journalist is supposed to resolve\r\n"
"things?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Sure, but... But I won't let this be the end of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I'll continue to follow the truth until the day I put down\r\n"
"my pen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "That's my duty as a reporter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "And I'll be cheering you on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "You got <Color:8>200,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>200.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You got 20,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

